The OpenAPI spec still emits discriminator blocks for oneOf schemas where the discriminator field does not exist on the mapped schemas.
Example shape:
{
  "oneOf": [
    { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreatewmsOrder--Finale--" }
  ],
  "discriminator": {
    "propertyName": "type",
    "mapping": {
      "finale": "#/components/schemas/CreatewmsOrder--Finale--"
    }
  }
}For that to be valid, CreatewmsOrder--Finale-- needs to define a real type property, ideally required and constrained:
{
  "required": ["type"],
  "properties": {
    "type": {
      "type": "string",
      "const": "finale"
    }
  }
}

